OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 begins worldwide
OL,4,Arelease after 13-year wait - and the
OL,5,Aearly reviews are in
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 begins its launch,
OL,8,Fending gamers' 13-year wait for a new
OL,9,Finstalment
OL,11,FThe game is released at midnight around
OL,12,Fthe world, meaning people in New
OL,13,FZealand became the first to play at
OL,14,F11:00 GMT
OL,16,FReviews, so far, give the game a score
OL,17,Fof 99, according to Metacritic
OL,19,FMany critics are praising it as
OL,20,F"exquisitely detailed" and "mature",
OL,21,Fthough some say it has "flaws"
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
